    {
      "title": "UniFi Access Point | Releases | Ubiquiti Community",
      "feedUrl": "https://community.ui.com/rss/releases/UniFi-Access-Point-Switch/9fc3b2fa-9e73-449a-924f-470e79884470",
      "siteUrl": "https://community.ui.com",
      "articles": [
        {
          "id": "c60a703f-fbe1-43bc-a127-702004c37ad1",
          "author": "UI-Edmundas",
          "description": "Improvements\n\nImproved stability.\n\nBugfixes\n\nFixed Client Device Isolation not being enforced on some wireless networks.\n\nAdditional information\nIf you encounter any issues with this release, please provide us with some details on your setup and include the below information:\n\nAP model(s)\nPrevious AP release version\nUniFi Network application version",
          "link": "https://community.ui.com/releases/UniFi-Access-Point-for-U7-LR-8-0-76/c60a703f-fbe1-43bc-a127-702004c37ad1",
          "publishedOn": "2026-08-31T14:35:58.000Z",
          "wordCount": 5,
          "title": "UniFi Access Point for U7-LR 8.0.76",
          "imageUrl": null
        },
        {
          "id": "97000981-b2ee-4a8d-a783-ed251b8c04c1",
          "author": "UI-Edmundas",
          "description": "Overview\nThis release is only for these models:\n\nU6-LR/U6-Lite\nUAP-nanoHD/FlexHD/BeaconHD/IW-HD\n\nImprovements\n\nAdded Test & Confirm mode to automatically revert configuration changes if the device becomes unreachable or the test period expires without confirmation.\n\nBugfixes\n\nFixed clients failing to receive an IP address after changing an Enterprise WiFi network to Open.\nFixed certain 2.4 GHz IoT devices repeatedly reconnecting while appearing connected.\nFixed an issue where U6-LR could report unusually high channel utilization.\n\nAdditional information\nIf you encounter any issues with this release, please provide us with some details on your setup and include the below information:\n\nAP model(s)\nPrevious AP release version\nUniFi Network application version",
          "link": "https://community.ui.com/releases/UniFi-Access-Point-for-U6-LR-U6-Lite-and-more-6-7-57/97000981-b2ee-4a8d-a783-ed251b8c04c1",
          "publishedOn": "2026-08-25T14:57:18.000Z",
          "wordCount": 5,
          "title": "UniFi Access Point for U6-LR, U6-Lite & more 6.7.57",
          "imageUrl": null
        }
      ]
    },
